# The per-cell E3 store. `run_ab.py` points CARNOT_ARC_E3_DIR here so nothing can write into
# results/arc_e3, which is EVIDENCE. It holds one directory per collected cell and is pure
# scratch: every engine that matters is copied to out/engines/ with a stable name, and every
# number derived from one is in out/cells/ and out/scored.json.
e3_store/
__pycache__/
.ruff_cache/
out/_job.json
# The window pickles are binary and rebuildable from the roster; the split they encode is
# recorded in meta.json:split_meta, which is what a reader needs.
out/windows/
